# Video lives in R2 (see MEDIA.md) — 1.1 GB of it, so it stays out of git.
# Posters and portraits stay committed so the site still renders stills with
# VITE_R2_PUBLIC_URL unset.
#
# public/film/ is the deliberate exception and is NOT ignored: it holds the
# one clip that ships with the site rather than with the bucket, because it is
# the first thing the About page asks for and the bucket's public hostname
# costs a fresh handshake to reach. Eleven megabytes in the repo is the price
# of that; keep it to assets that earn it.
public/media/video/
public/media/preview/
public/media/audio/
